Disegno CAD (this version)

This is a modified version of CADCraft, adapted for classroom use at the Scuola Secondaria di
I grado R. Montecuccoli, Pavullo nel Frignano (Italy): a school sign-in with Google, saving to the
student's Google Drive, hand-in links, a Simple mode, and a changed name. The modifications are by
Benedetto Amalfi, teacher of Technology at that school, and are licensed under the same terms as
CADCraft (MIT OR Apache-2.0). Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 Benedetto Amalfi.
